sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Schnakenberg (1979) tri-molecular limit-cycle & Turing reaction-diffusion morphogenesis — MorphoEval overall 90.0/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `1979-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing.py` (overall score 90.2/100, up from 44.5/100 in Pass 1). The remediated script implements Schnakenberg's (1979) exact equilibrium (u_*, v_*) = (a+b, b/(a+b)^2), Hopf bifurcation curve b - a = (a+b)^3 (max |tr(J_0)| = 0.0), critical Turing diffusivity ratio d_c(a,b) = 8.567627, and spatial dispersion relation sigma(k^2) (k_c = 6.6750 rad/unit, lambda_c = 0.9413 units); integrates the autonomous Poincare-Bendixson relaxation limit cycle (period T_LC = 19.625, amplitude 6.825); simulates 5 canonical regimes plus a 7-point diffusivity-ratio sweep across d_c (matching analytical lambda_c within 0.42%, k* = 6.7031 vs k_c = 6.6750); and segments the SHA-256-locked Dictyostelium discoideum sorocarp specimen (d_sorus = 32.95 px, inter-sorus spacing 465.42 px, ratio 14.13, 5 DoG mounds, and 73.14 px agar FFT wavelength), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems. Overall 90.0/100 (faithfulness 89.2, reproducibility 91.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 86, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 89, Source and data traceability 93, Code-to-model traceability 91, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/limit_cycle_turing_comparison.png: rendered output of 1979-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing.py at 8871db0, image/png, 650791 B, 2940×1750 px, artifact_sha256 076cb14f1cdd4edae1faf1bf08881306ce6cc3e38cc0e0cad0e244e5316e71dd (sha256 076cb14f1cdd4edae1faf1bf08881306ce6cc3e38cc0e0cad0e244e5316e71dd), spec_fingerprint 2171bdf8211cc376e4fec882bcd645f848050c6a4e0c6d15ce22984bb3384713. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 2171bdf8211cc376e4fec882bcd645f848050c6a4e0c6d15ce22984bb3384713; artifact_sha256: 076cb14f1cdd4edae1faf1bf08881306ce6cc3e38cc0e0cad0e244e5316e71dd; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/limit_cycle_turing/dictyostelium_specimen.jpg=e2d2b739211bda97..., datasets/limit_cycle_turing/limit_cycle_turing_reference.json=cc22252b314c8bb8..., datasets/limit_cycle_turing/scout_manifest.json=e71deffb9f317a88...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-limit-cycle-turing-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Extend the 2D Schnakenberg solver to curved hemispherical mound geometries to model 3D Dictyostelium culmination stalk elongation.",
            "remediation needed: Incorporate explicit extracellular phosphodiesterase degradation kinetics to compare minimal 2-species Schnakenberg limit cycles against the 3-variable Martiel-Goldbeter cAMP relay model." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.9"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary) + Claude Sonnet 5.5 High (second assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

